     1042     END PROCEDURE.
     1043   PROCEDURE adm-copy-record :
     1044       MESSAGE "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1045        "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Copy.":U
     1046          VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
