     1076   PROCEDURE adm-update-record :
     1077       MESSAGE
     1078         "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1079           "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Update.":U
     1080             VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
